Package: OhdsiAtlasClient
Type: Package
Title: Client for OHDSI ATLAS 3.0 and WebAPI 3.0
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-11-20
Authors@R:
    person("Jamie", "Gilbert", email = "gilbert@ohdsi.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A client for the OHDSI ATLAS 3.0 and WebAPI 3.0 REST
    interface. Discovers a deployment from its URL, negotiates the WebAPI
    version, authenticates with personal API keys, and provides typed access
    to sources, vocabularies, concept sets, cohort definitions, cohort
    definition sets, CDM results, jobs, and analysis resources. Cohort
    definition sets are portable JSON or ZIP bundles containing cohort
    expressions and their embedded concept sets. The package targets ATLAS
    3.0 and newer only.
